{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EwFuoSkYubxqyhcZqtNrbr","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":" SELECT r.legal_name AS company,\n    r.funding_limit,\n    COALESCE(ap.approved, (0)::numeric) AS approved,\n    COALESCE(k.contracted, (0)::numeric) AS contracted,\n    (r.funding_limit - COALESCE(k.contracted, (0)::numeric)) AS remaining\n   FROM ((reg.counterparty r\n     LEFT JOIN ( SELECT application.company_inn,\n            sum(application.amount) AS approved\n           FROM api.application\n          WHERE (application.status_id = priv.status_id('Одобрена'::text))\n          GROUP BY application.company_inn) ap ON ((ap.company_inn = r.inn)))\n     LEFT JOIN ( SELECT a.company_inn,\n            sum(k_1.amount) AS contracted\n           FROM (api.contract k_1\n             JOIN api.application a ON ((a.id = k_1.application_id)))\n          GROUP BY a.company_inn) k ON ((k.company_inn = r.inn)));\n20099|З-004|7700002018|20000|800000|4000000|Проект 4: модернизация производства||\n20105|З-005|7700002018|20001|4800000|19200000|Проект 5: модернизация производства||\n20111|З-006|7700002018|20002|4200000|33600000|Проект 6: модернизация производства|expert1|\n21022|З-012|7700002018|20003|2000000|8000000|Проект 12: расширение производства|expert1|Рекомендую к финансированию\n21038|З-014|7700002018|20004|800000|3200000|Проект 14: расширение производства|expert1|Нет рынка сбыта\n20000|Черновик|1\n20001|Подана|2\n20002|На экспертизе|3\n20003|Одобрена|4\n20004|Отклонена|5\nid|integer||not null|nextval('api.contract_id_seq'::regclass)\nnumber|text||not null|\napplication_id|integer||not null|\namount|numeric||not null|\nsigned_on|date|||\nstatus|text||not null|'Проект'::text\n"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4e5a211-3ada-40a3-bc9b-0e98fe4ea0d2","uuid":"ed294fb0-d8c8-4293-8919-f27efdca822f","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:15:15.130Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":" SELECT r.legal_name AS company,\n   